%% Webhook 3 — introduction de parole (spontaneite)
%% Export → public/ch3-webhook3-spontaneite-mermaid.png

sequenceDiagram
    participant BE as Backend / vision
    participant N8N as Webhook 3 n8n
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant CD as Code11
    participant AI as AI Agent
    participant R as Robot

    BE->>N8N: username (connu ou unkonu)
    N8N->>PG: Fiches Webhook 2 (accompagnement)
    PG-->>N8N: interets, synthese, conseils
    alt utilisateur connu
        N8N->>CD: Contexte personnalise
        CD-->>N8N: Prompt accueil
        N8N->>AI: AI Agent (introduction)
    else unkonu
        N8N->>AI: AI Agent (invitation)
    end
    AI-->>N8N: parole_du_robot, emotion_visuelle
    N8N-->>BE: Reponse JSON
    BE->>R: TTS + expression faciale
